<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch state bond sale raises Dfl 1.9 bln so far.</title>
<headline>Dutch state bond sale raises Dfl 1.9 bln so far.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch Finance Ministry's capital markets agency said on Tuesday that 1.9 billion guilders had been raised so far through tap sales of the 5.75 percent government bond due February 2007.</p>
<p>Tap sales of the bond, first issued in January, reopened today and will continue daily between 0700 GMT and 1500 GMT until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
